^{:go/end 220} (go/func randFieldElement "randFieldElement returns a random element of the order of the given\ncurve using the procedure given in FIPS 186-4, Appendix B.5.2.\n" [^elliptic/Curve c ^io/Reader rand] :results [^{:tag (* big/Int)} k ^error err]
